                                "sense_id": "2a3aa8e6-1b2a-35ca-9222-db441fd0aa5d",
                                "text": "Those at risk include the wood thrush, a well-known songbird, and the Baltimore oriole, the mascot of Maryland’s baseball team."
                            }
